Third-party data and services
-----------------------------

Airports (services/map/public/airports.json)
  Generated from OurAirports (https://ourairports.com/data/), released into the
  public domain by its authors.

Map tiles and style
  OpenFreeMap (https://openfreemap.org), map data © OpenStreetMap contributors,
  available under the Open Database License (ODbL). Attribution is shown on the map.

Aircraft information (runtime only, nothing is redistributed)
  - tar1090 aircraft database, served by the user's own receiver.
  - hexdb.io (https://hexdb.io), queried from the browser for registration/type.

Weather (runtime only)
  METAR from the Aviation Weather Center (https://aviationweather.gov), NOAA.

Font
  Inter (https://rsms.me/inter), SIL Open Font License 1.1, loaded from Google Fonts.

Airline names and colours
  packages/shared/src/data/airlines.json lists airline names, ICAO/IATA codes and a
  representative colour, used to draw a text badge. These are factual identifiers;
  airline names are trademarks of their respective owners.

Airline logos
  Not included. Airline logos are trademarks of their owners. If the user sets
  `airline_logos: true`, FlightFlow downloads them at runtime from images.kiwi.com
  into the user's own data folder for personal use. They are never committed to
  this repository or included in the published image.

Aircraft drawings (packages/shared/src/art/aircraft/*.svg)
  Original work by the author, MIT licensed. The side profiles are generated
  parametrically from published dimensions (length, fuselage radius, wing and
  door positions…) plus a small number of control points measured by the author
  on reference side views, then smoothed and drawn in FlightFlow's own style.
  No third-party artwork is included.
